          },
          "author": "Momma Bear Audio",
          "description": "Zoom Zoom Zara is back with 10 new interactive adventures filled with movement, imagination and playful storytelling!Join Zara and her best friend, Dash the Bunny, as they search for a missing acorn necklace, rescue a baby bird, chase a runaway scooter and even save the Big Acorn Parade! But watch out! Sneaky Squirrel is always nearby, causing a little trouble along the way.In each adventure, kids become part of the story as they hop, stretch, stomp, clap and help Zara overcome obstacles. They’ll even earn a special imaginary hero badge for their efforts!Designed for preschoolers and early elementary kids, these screen-free adventures encourage active listening, following directions, movement and imaginative play while reinforcing positive qualities like kindness, bravery, teamwork and friendship.Run Time: 41 min\n\nLooking for other free audio sources, ideas and inspo? Maybe you want to submit a request for some sort of specific audio for your kids? Join my FB Group! I am always taking suggestions and working to get the audio your kids want.\nToyo Momma Bear source: 8ab3ae8e4b88492de346ac51eae8a4667144761deb381df448090f253136713b",
